    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE **\n\nWe are delighted to offer to the market Apartment no.28, The Blake, an exceptional penthouse residence located within the highly regarded Fanan development on the Letteragh Road. Constructed in 2022 by Burkeway Homes, this stunning two-bedroom apartment represents the very best of contemporary apartment living, combining stylish design, premium finishes, and spectacular panoramic views.\n\nExtending to approximately 1040 square ft of beautifully presented living accommodation, this impressive penthouse has been thoughtfully designed to maximise natural light and take full advantage of its elevated position. From the moment you enter, the sense of space is immediately apparent, with high ceilings, generous room proportions, and a sophisticated interior palette creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout.\n\nThe heart of the home is a superb open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area, perfectly suited to modern lifestyles. The contemporary kitchen is fully fitted with integrated appliances and high-quality finishes, while engineered flooring throughout enhances the elegant finish. Large glazed openings lead to two private balconies, offering dual-aspect outdoor living spaces and providing a wonderful setting for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nBeing sold fully furnished with top class furniture to include King Koil Beds, Soul living room suite and bespoke dining table and chairs. \n\nOne of the apartment's most striking features is the breathtaking outlook. Residents can enjoy spectacular views stretching across Galway city, Galway Bay, and the Clare Hills, creating an ever-changing backdrop that can be appreciated from both the living accommodation and outdoor terraces.\n\nOffering an excellent opportunity for those seeking a high-yeild investment property with its proximity to the Regional Hospital and the University of Galway.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition, Apartment 28 offers all the benefits of a modern, energy-efficient home within a professionally managed development. Whether you are a first-time buyer, downsizer, investor, or professional seeking a premium Galway residence, this property is sure to impress.\n\nKey Features:\nBuilt by Burkeway Homes in 2022\nApproximately 97m² of accommodation\nStunning views \nTwo private dual-aspect balconies\nFully integrated kitchen\nEngineered flooring throughout\nHigh ceilings \nPressurised hot water system\nDimplex eHeat electric heating system\nAudio intercom system\nLift access within the building\nPrivate storage locker\nSecure bicycle storage facilities\nCommunal resident parking\nAnnual Mgt Charges 2,420.\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Leonard & Heaslip has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Leonard & Heaslip accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.1m x 1.3\nEngineered floors.\n\nOpen Plan Living/Dining area - 6.3m x 4.5m\nEngineered floors. Blinds. Door to terraced balcony.\n\nKitchen area - 3.7m x 2.4m\nFully integrated kitchen. Includes double oven, hob & extractor, dishwasher, Fridge/Freezer. Breakfast island.\n\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 1.9m\nPlumbed for washing machine & dryer. Shelving units.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.7m x 3.7m\nEngineered floors. Curtains,. Double built in wadrobes\n\nEn-suite - 2.3m x 1.6m\nTiled floors and surrounds. Stand alone shower\n\nBedroom Two - 4.6m x 3.0m\nEngineered floors. Blinds. Built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.9m\nTiled floors and surrounds. Shower on bath. Heated towel rail.\n\n"
